#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:4
msgid "NSX-T Certificate Management"
msgstr "NSX-T Certificate Management"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides integrated certificate management for VMware NSX-T "
"environments. NSX-T requires certificates for securing communications "
"between its management plane, control plane, and transport nodes. |morpheus|"
" can manage the lifecycle of these certificates, including uploading "
"certificates to NSX-T managers and associating them with NSX-T services."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| proporciona integrated certificado gestión para VMware NSX-T "
"entornos. NSX-T requiere certificados para securing communications entre su "
"gestión plane, plano de control, y transport nodos. |morpheus| puede manage "
"el lifecycle de estos certificados, incluyendo uploading certificados a "
"NSX-T managers y associating them con NSX-T servicios."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:11
msgid ""
"This feature is available when an NSX-T integration has been configured in "
"|morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Este función está disponible cuando un NSX-T integration ha sido configurado"
" en |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:14
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Requisitos previos"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:16
msgid ""
"An active NSX-T integration configured in |morpheus| (Infrastructure > "
"Network > Integrations)"
msgstr ""
"Un activo NSX-T integration configurado en |morpheus| (Infraestructura > Red"
" > Integraciones)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:17
msgid "NSX-T Manager version 2.5 or higher"
msgstr "NSX-T Manager versión 2.5 o higher"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:18
msgid "Appropriate NSX-T API permissions for certificate management"
msgstr "Appropriate NSX-T API permisos para certificado gestión"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:19
msgid "Valid SSL/TLS certificates compatible with NSX-T requirements"
msgstr "Válido SSL/TLS certificados compatible con NSX-T requisitos"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:22
msgid "NSX-T Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "NSX-T Certificate Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:24
msgid "NSX-T has specific requirements for certificates:"
msgstr "NSX-T tiene específico requisitos para certificados:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:26
msgid "**Format:** PEM-encoded X.509 certificates"
msgstr "**Format:** PEM-encoded X.509 certificados"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:27
msgid "**Key Size:** Minimum 2048-bit RSA or 256-bit ECDSA"
msgstr "**Key Size:** Mínimo 2048-bit RSA o 256-bit ECDSA"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Subject Alternative Names (SANs):** Must include the FQDN and IP address "
"of the NSX-T Manager nodes"
msgstr ""
"**Subject Alternative Names (SANs):** Debe incluir el FQDN y IP dirección "
"del NSX-T Manager nodos"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Extended Key Usage:** Server Authentication (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1) and Client"
" Authentication (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.2) as appropriate"
msgstr ""
"**Extended Key Usage:** Servidor Autenticación (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1) y Cliente"
" Autenticación (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.2) según corresponda"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Validity:** Certificates should have sufficient validity period "
"(recommended minimum 1 year)"
msgstr ""
"**Validity:** Certificates debería tienen sufficient validity period "
"(recommended mínimo 1 year)"

